@page "/"
<PageTitle>CompileCare | Connected Hospital Operations</PageTitle>
<main>
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="container hero-content">
            <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> A hospital platform built around connected care</div>
            <h1>One connected view of the <span>hospital journey.</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-lead">CompileCare is being built to bring patient access, hospital operations and care workflows together on a secure, modular foundation—designed for the realities of hospitals in India.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/features">Explore the platform <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/technology">Explore the technology</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Platform in active development · Capabilities are delivered incrementally</div>
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="visual-top"><span class="visual-brand"><span class="brand-mark small">+</span> CompileCare workspace</span><span class="visual-label">Illustrative product direction</span></div>
                <div class="visual-body">
                    <aside class="visual-sidebar"><span class="side-mark active"></span><span class="side-mark"></span><span class="side-mark"></span><span class="side-mark"></span><span class="side-mark"></span></aside>
                    <div class="visual-main">
                        <div class="visual-heading"><div><span class="visual-kicker">HOSPITAL OPERATIONS</span><strong>Care, connected.</strong></div><span class="visual-date">Workspace concept</span></div>
                        <div class="visual-stats"><div><span>Patient access</span><b>01</b><small>Registration & identity</small></div><div><span>Daily flow</span><b>02</b><small>Appointments & queue</small></div><div><span>Care delivery</span><b>03</b><small>OPD documentation</small></div></div>
                        <div class="visual-flow"><div class="flow-node"><span>01</span><b>Reception</b><small>Register · Find</small></div><i>→</i><div class="flow-node"><span>02</span><b>Appointments</b><small>Schedule · Check in</small></div><i>→</i><div class="flow-node"><span>03</span><b>Clinical</b><small>Document · Sign</small></div><i>→</i><div class="flow-node"><span>04</span><b>Billing</b><small>Invoice · Receipt</small></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-intro">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <span class="section-kicker">THE COMPILECARE APPROACH</span>
                <h2>Hospital software should work as <span>one system.</span></h2>
                <p>Disconnected tools create repeated work and fragmented information. CompileCare’s product vision is an integrated, permission-aware platform where each hospital capability has a clear place and a governed path to connect.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-grid">
                <article class="principle-card"><div class="principle-icon">◎</div><h3>Patient-centred</h3><p>Connect registration, identity, scheduling, queue and care documentation around the patient journey.</p></article>
                <article class="principle-card"><div class="principle-icon">⌘</div><h3>Modular by design</h3><p>Deliver coherent hospital capabilities in bounded modules, without forcing premature service fragmentation.</p></article>
                <article class="principle-card"><div class="principle-icon">⬡</div><h3>Secure foundations</h3><p>Build tenant isolation, organization scope, least-privilege access and auditable actions into the platform.</p></article>
                <article class="principle-card"><div class="principle-icon">↗</div><h3>Ready to evolve</h3><p>Use documented APIs and integration boundaries to support future hospital systems and partners.</p></article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-dark">
        <div class="container split-heading">
            <div><span class="section-kicker light">CURRENT DELIVERY</span><h2>A strong outpatient foundation.<br/><span>A wider hospital vision.</span></h2></div>
            <p>Core outpatient and platform foundations are implemented in the codebase. Inpatient, diagnostics, pharmacy and other capabilities remain planned or under design. Explore the full catalogue with clear delivery labels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="container module-preview">
            <a href="/features#platform" class="module-tile"><span>01</span><b>Platform & security</b><small>Tenant lifecycle · Memberships · Roles</small></a>
            <a href="/features#patient" class="module-tile"><span>02</span><b>Patient services</b><small>Registration · MRN · Duplicate review</small></a>
            <a href="/features#frontdesk" class="module-tile"><span>03</span><b>Appointments & front desk</b><small>Availability · Walk-ins · Queue</small></a>
            <a href="/features#clinical" class="module-tile"><span>04</span><b>OPD & clinical</b><small>Encounters · Notes · Signatures</small></a>
            <a href="/features#billing" class="module-tile"><span>05</span><b>Billing foundation</b><small>Catalogue · Invoices · Payments</small></a>
            <a href="/features#future" class="module-tile"><span>06</span><b>Future hospital modules</b><small>IPD · Pharmacy · Diagnostics · More</small></a>
        </div>
        <div class="container section-action"><a class="text-link light-link" href="/features">View all modules and delivery status <span>→</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container architecture-panel">
            <div><span class="section-kicker">ENGINEERED FOR TRUST</span><h2>Built on a modern, observable foundation.</h2><p>The platform combines a .NET API, PostgreSQL persistence, a React workspace, OpenID Connect identity and an OpenTelemetry-based observability stack. The public website and authenticated hospital workspace are separate applications.</p><a class="text-link" href="/technology">See the complete technology stack <span>→</span></a></div>
            <div class="architecture-list"><div><span class="arch-number">01</span><div><b>API-first backend</b><small>.NET 10 · ASP.NET Core · EF Core</small></div></div><div><span class="arch-number">02</span><div><b>Transactional data</b><small>PostgreSQL · tenant-aware persistence</small></div></div><div><span class="arch-number">03</span><div><b>Identity & access</b><small>OIDC · JWT validation · persisted membership</small></div></div><div><span class="arch-number">04</span><div><b>Observability</b><small>OpenTelemetry · Prometheus · Jaeger · Elastic</small></div></div></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing-cta">
        <div class="container cta-inner"><div><span class="section-kicker light">BUILDING BETTER HOSPITAL WORKFLOWS</span><h2>Explore what CompileCare is building.</h2><p>Review the product scope, implementation status and technology choices—or get in touch to discuss hospital workflow requirements.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="btn btn-white" href="/features">Explore capabilities</a><a class="btn btn-outline-white" href="/contact">Contact CompileCare</a></div></div>
    </section>
</main>
